  "notes": "Sampoerna Agro (SGRO) — IDX-listed Indonesian palm oil + sago + rubber producer, ~95k planted ha (~234k acres). IPO June 2007 on IDX. Largest sago producer in Indonesia (Selat Panjang, Riau). Reports under PSAK 69 (biological assets at FV) from 2012 onward; pre-2012 historical cost. Quarterly + FY filings via IDX (laporan keuangan). Values in IDR millions (matches seed-comps.json convention). Segment split: CPO ~80-85% revenue, PK ~6-8%, Sago ~5-8%, Rubber/Other ~2-4%. FV adjustment on biological assets appears in expensesBySegmentMM where disclosed. Quarterly EBITDA estimated from gross profit + D&A where not directly disclosed; FY data from audited annual reports. Pre-2020 history sourced from SGRO annual report 5-year summary tables (IR archive) — annual only, quarterly archives sparse.",
